  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling LGIs for Sustainable Sanitation and Waste Management in Selected Municipalities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refresher Trainings/Workshops for Municipal Officials on FSM Service Delivery Plans &amp; Business Models. Establish &amp; Strengthen Proper O&amp;M Systems with Business Models for Cost Recovery. Formalising Desludging Business &amp; Creating Enabling Environment for Sustainable Desludging Services. Organise Training for Private Operators with DPHE Support. Arranging Demand Generation Activities Through Ward Based Awareness Programmes. Ensuring Functional and Adequately Staffed Waste Management/FSM Cell.</narrative>
